{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09274","headline":"授衣还田里 · 韦应物","name":"授衣还田里","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公门悬甲令，澣濯遂其私。\n晨起怀怆恨，野田寒露时。\n气收天地广，风凄草木衰。\n山明始重叠，川浅更逶迤。\n烟火生闾里，禾黍积东菑。\n终然可乐业，时节一来斯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09274.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09274","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}